{"text":"So, the leverage that China has from the debt perspective is enormous. But additionally, China is the largest trading partner, lender, as well as a foreign direct investor in the emerging markets today. It's bigger than the World Bank, it's bigger than the IMF, and it's bigger than Paris Club. And to the extent that China has this influence, certainly in the debt markets and in an environment of rising interest rates, this has become another more poignant issue to deal with on the geopolitical stage. And indeed, I think all eyes, aside from being here in the CPS, all eyes will be looking to the G20 meetings, certainly between President Xi and President Biden.","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":0.32,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":0.32,"end":0.58},{"text":"leverage","start":0.58,"end":0.98},{"text":"that","start":0.98,"end":1.22},{"text":"China","start":1.22,"end":1.48},{"text":"has","start":1.48,"end":2.06},{"text":"from","start":2.06,"end":2.66},{"text":"the","start":2.66,"end":2.98},{"text":"debt","start":2.98,"end":3.4},{"text":"perspective","start":3.4,"end":3.88},{"text":"is","start":3.88,"end":4.12},{"text":"enormous","start":4.12,"end":4.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":5.42,"end":5.46},{"text":"additionally","start":5.46,"end":6.26,"punct":","},{"text":"China","start":7.06,"end":7.16},{"text":"is","start":7.16,"end":7.58},{"text":"the","start":7.58,"end":8.02},{"text":"largest","start":8.02,"end":8.66},{"text":"trading","start":8.66,"end":9.28},{"text":"partner","start":9.28,"end":9.92,"punct":","},{"text":"lender","start":10.6,"end":10.8,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":11.62,"end":11.64},{"text":"well","start":11.64,"end":12.04},{"text":"as","start":12.04,"end":14.12},{"text":"a","start":14.12,"end":14.38},{"text":"foreign","start":14.38,"end":14.66},{"text":"direct","start":14.66,"end":15.0},{"text":"investor","start":15.0,"end":15.64},{"text":"in","start":15.64,"end":16.12},{"text":"the","start":16.12,"end":16.26},{"text":"emergin